                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            equipped with the uniform discrete probability measure; we find
          #eq:Boltzmann.maruku-equation
            %span.maruku-eq-number (8)
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
